    <briefdescription>
<para>Standards-style forward iterator over the <computeroutput><ref refid="structvecterm" kindref="compound">vecterm</ref></computeroutput>s of one column. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Simpler companion to <computeroutput><ref refid="class_matrix_1_1iterator" kindref="compound">iterator</ref></computeroutput>: holds a raw <computeroutput>const vecterm*</computeroutput> cursor, increments it with <computeroutput>operator++</computeroutput>, dereferences with <computeroutput>operator*</computeroutput>, and ends at <computeroutput>nullptr</computeroutput>. Suitable for range-for over a single column&apos;s terms. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
